  "title": "Ibm Security Advisories - 2026-08-11",
  "description": "Merged 13 ibm security advisories published on 2026-08-11. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7283253, IBM-7283256, IBM-7283359, IBM-7283252, IBM-7283292, IBM-7283274, IBM-7283289, IBM-7282933, IBM-7282930, IBM-7282932, IBM-7282851, IBM-7283146, IBM-7283241\n\nTitles:\n- IBM Decision Intelligence Client Managed Software (Formerly Known as IBM Automation Decision Services)  for July 2026- Multiple CVEs addressed\n- IBM Cloud Pak for Data System (CPDS 1x) is affected by multiple critical vulnerabilities in OpenSSL, Java SE, and Jetty\n- IBM Db2 Mirror for i is affected by multiple vulnerabilities\n- IBM Engineering Lifecycle Management - Engineering Workflow Management is impacted by vulnerabilities in bootstrap-3.4.1.tgz client library\n- IBM i is Affected By Multiple Vulnerabilities in Navigator for i\n- IBM i is Affected By Improper Validation Vulnerability in Line Printer Daemon [CVE-2026-17445]\n- IBM i is Affected By Multiple Vulnerabilities in SQL\n- IBM InfoSphere Information Server is affected by multiple vulnerabilities in QOS.CH Sarl logback\n- IBM InfoSphere Information Server is affected by multiple vulnerabilities in json\n- IBM InfoSphere Information Server is affected by multiple vulnerabilities in Apache Thrift\n- Vulnerability in OpenSSL affects IBM Netezza Appliance\n- IBM WebSphere Application Server - Liberty is affected by multiple vulnerabilities\n- IBM Transformation Extender Advanced is affected by IBM WebSphere Application Server Liberty vulnerabilities",
